   "id": "dark-auction-264359@major-2026-04-17",
   "gameId": "dark-auction-264359",
   "displayName": "Update Notice (April 17, 2026)",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-04-17T10:01:49.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45172921/c5a080a98068c27a39cb3bc2aec4e578d5436546.png\"]",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Patch Notes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improvements to keyboard and mouse controls",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Updated artwork on Otto’s Floor (Sun Floor)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Minor bug fixes and overall improvements: With this update, some default settings for keyboard & mouse controls have been revised.: As a result, new default key bindings have been applied.: \\[Example of Default Settings]: Confirm: Space key (Enter key and left mouse click are also always available): Cancel: Esc key: Many other key bindings have also been changed.: Please refer to the image below for full details.: If you wish to customize your key bindings, you can do so via “Input Settings” in the Options menu.: [img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45172921/95ca41e252263214df8c9479ef75eae5ebca7481.png\"]: To ensure the best possible experience, we kindly ask that you update the game to the latest version.: We will continue to improve Dark Auction going forward.: We welcome your feedback and suggestions—please contact us via the community forums or our customer support.: [dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2363180/_\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
